{"3155310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Three Kingdoms of Shadows: Xuzhou", "steam_appid": 3155310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Three Kingdoms of Shadows twists the Romance of the Three Kingdoms into something darker — a strategy game of faction politics, resource management, and warfare, set in a world where history bleeds into occult folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Liu Bei. Drawing on the Records of the Three Kingdoms and the Yingxiong Ji, this reimagining casts your succession in Xuzhou as a calculated political gamble. The local power blocs led by Chen Deng and Mi Zhu elevate you as Tao Qian's successor, expecting an inexperienced outsider they can control — a convenient puppet. Prove them wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a leader in chaotic times, strike a balance between policy, resources, warfare, and law. Govern your city, weigh conflicting counsel, contend with rival warlords, and make decisions that can bend history itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Shadows&quot; in the title echoes the Chinese character「阴」(Yin: shadow, occult, eerie), reflecting the unsettling folklore beneath the world and its story. The main campaign remains grounded in historical strategy: ordinary decrees and battles are not supernatural. Occult investigations are optional side stories, pursued only if you choose to follow them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two paths await:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Follow the historical route and steer events toward the chronicles you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Investigate every optional mystery to unlock the hidden Hegemony route — an alternate history no chronicle ever recorded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[This is not a horror game. A small number of jump scares may occur while exploring eerie side stories. You can enable the “Horror Content Filter” in Settings; once enabled, it will suppress all jump-scare visuals.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. See through misleading counsel and choose the wisest course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/0ef179d2c579085a7ae37e1538169101.webp?t=1787804515\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/0ef179d2c579085a7ae37e1538169101.poster.avif?t=1787804515\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=634 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Chart distinct legal and policy paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/1eeadfe1b6b846195225e6e5416307d4.poster.avif?t=1787804515\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/1eeadfe1b6b846195225e6e5416307d4.mp4?t=1787804515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Wage war fueled by resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/4dded6b4247c8f61c679d1ae5c7a1ff7.poster.avif?t=1787804515\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/4dded6b4247c8f61c679d1ae5c7a1ff7.webm?t=1787804515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/4dded6b4247c8f61c679d1ae5c7a1ff7.mp4?t=1787804515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Complete storyline missions and reshape history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/122ce86b95046ddf8b049ec4ea5825fb.webp?t=1787804515\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/122ce86b95046ddf8b049ec4ea5825fb.poster.avif?t=1787804515\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=634 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Unravel optional side quests steeped in eerie mystery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/c78f3808af1ee5d3d4d102df2e3f5fe2.poster.avif?t=1787804515\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/c78f3808af1ee5d3d4d102df2e3f5fe2.mp4?t=1787804515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6.Challenge an NPC to a strategic game of Shigui Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/0ac63ee8204062ed54b17a3de4a0e8c8.poster.avif?t=1787804515\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/0ac63ee8204062ed54b17a3de4a0e8c8.webm?t=1787804515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155310/extras/0ac63ee8204062ed54b17a3de4a0e8c8.mp4?t=1787804515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From puppet to legendary warlord. Xuzhou was given to you on their terms — rule it on yours.</p><p class=\